 {r}←ns RegisterCustomID(txt sa bookmarkName)
⍝ A header with a custom ID ("{#xyz}") remembers the bookmark name its caption would get otherwise,
⍝ so that short bookmark links ("[Caption](#)") can be redirected to the custom ID later on.
 r←⍬
 :If 0≠≢bookmarkName
 :AndIf 0≠≢GetIdFromSpecialAttributes sa
     ns.customIDs⍪←(LowercaseID ns.parms.bookmarkMayStartWithDigit CompileBookMarkName txt'')bookmarkName
 :EndIf
